    letterTitle: A letter from home
    letter: "Dear Dad,\nMom says the heater makes the funny noise again. Pip drew
      you a picture of the station, it is in the next parcel.\nWe miss you. Work
      hard and come home soon.\n\u2014 Lena\n\n(placeholder text \u2013 P15)"
    newToday: 
